   "parent_id": "ef3aaadb-b3ef-4978-a036-e1bba58eff61",
   "body": "As the author wrote, Ghouls aren't a very good choice before level 60 (although the mana problem with them almost completely disappears).\nAmbo and Spider Mages - essentially, you don't need anything else while leveling. If you're on the battlefield, then two Spider Mages. While leveling, Spider Mages deal an insane amount of damage (check the DPS meter report).\nA full runic energy bar (100/25 = 4) is 4 shots from two Pawn Mages + at least one free proc. Just look at how much damage that does and you'll be smiling. But the closer you get to level 60, the less useful they become.",
