   "parent_id": "ef3aaadb-b3ef-4978-a036-e1bba58eff61",
   "body": "I have no experience in BG at level 30 for necro. When I tried to PvP before 60 it felt very bad so I didn't bother.",
   "upvotes": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-07-23T11:00:00.473163+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-23T22:56:26.369438+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "5ca8ad2c-63e2-4d40-9809-09c296f43d14",
    "username": "Pav",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMd6ErtQ1hjDwoMreY0PSYdtHhryOYTeYSWVGeTX-KdphiWO97=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "38ddccc3-ae85-48ee-bda0-b4b20da5dcb6",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "dd4134b1-5c98-47dc-8bf3-40f659c7334c",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "Hi, Im leveling, what are the talents I should prioritize first, how does that build  changes for BG.\n\nGreat guide thank you",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-23T14:31:27.759583+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-23T14:31:27.759583+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "dd4134b1-5c98-47dc-8bf3-40f659c7334c",
    "username": "Cipriano Samano",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ2kq57VRMpTGZeR4R5UfLpYZgfh-8TEwDxhtm_o5ydJvEfzA=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "9fb0320e-348e-4c5a-944c-d629cd0b59fc",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "e9de5c28-4138-41b2-a2dc-ca596c98375e",
   "parent_id": "ef3aaadb-b3ef-4978-a036-e1bba58eff61",
   "body": "Thanks all who replied! I am using spider mage at the 30-39 bracket bg, it is doing quite well in terms of damage and kills. As for Ghouls, i have more survivability but the damage is only decent and i have lesser kills.  Hopefully the spider mages don't fall off too much in the 40s and 50s brackets. I will test Ghouls in these brackets as well and feedback here later.",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-23T22:59:46.066223+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-23T22:59:46.066223+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "e9de5c28-4138-41b2-a2dc-ca596c98375e",
    "username": "immaculate_quail_95140",
    "avatar_url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "43cc77a1-db9c-4d84-982a-03c3c06e14ef",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "8d1a18f5-603b-49d6-affb-acc7cb33a147",
   "parent_id": null,
   "body": "How does this build feel against infernal and tyrant felsworns?\nAlso don't they range out Frost Wyrm, and wait from afar for it to expire within 30s?\n\nAdditionaly how does this build fare vs Primalists, Tinkers, Pyromancers, Chronos?",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-24T21:25:21.051925+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-24T21:25:21.051925+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "8d1a18f5-603b-49d6-affb-acc7cb33a147",
    "username": "naijaro",
    "avatar_url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/1182765299112611960/47d0fd19012f018d592ef3ec862d941d.png"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "a12a93d6-7284-472b-9e31-425f16bfef76",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "5ca8ad2c-63e2-4d40-9809-09c296f43d14",
   "parent_id": "38ddccc3-ae85-48ee-bda0-b4b20da5dcb6",
   "body": "If you are leveling then I recommend playing the class and learning it, there is no point min-maxing, but animation feels strongest",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-25T11:40:51.46482+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-25T11:40:51.46482+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "5ca8ad2c-63e2-4d40-9809-09c296f43d14",
    "username": "Pav",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMd6ErtQ1hjDwoMreY0PSYdtHhryOYTeYSWVGeTX-KdphiWO97=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "103338de-20e8-40ee-9245-50234ae452be",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "5ca8ad2c-63e2-4d40-9809-09c296f43d14",
   "parent_id": "43cc77a1-db9c-4d84-982a-03c3c06e14ef",
   "body": "Felsworn are a bad matchup for us so not very good but that might be only their meta spec. You will lose to most Felsworn past 1500 they are too strong right now. \n\nPrimalists are also a bad match up for us, tinkers are God in 1v1. \n\nPyro and Chrono are fairly easy wins.",
   "upvotes": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-25T11:44:02.605277+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-25T11:44:02.605277+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "5ca8ad2c-63e2-4d40-9809-09c296f43d14",
    "username": "Pav",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMd6ErtQ1hjDwoMreY0PSYdtHhryOYTeYSWVGeTX-KdphiWO97=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "6a0deba8-d818-441c-a845-6b833033315a",
   "build_id": "44c7dcf0-687e-4bc6-8052-b819dfdc1e90",
   "author_id": "e9de5c28-4138-41b2-a2dc-ca596c98375e",
   "parent_id": "ef3aaadb-b3ef-4978-a036-e1bba58eff61",
   "body": "Just to update, I'm blasting in 40-49 using 2 x Crypt Fiends and 1 x Rogue. I am almost always top kills and damage. Go for the haste and runic generation talents, and you will generate runic power so fast that you can keep spamming \"Command\". It's nice to see your Crypt Fiends blasting like gatling gun!",
   "upvotes": 0,
